                                "sense_id": "ad82120a-d0ef-3c36-af0b-09b13aa73f6a",
                                "text": "It was soon after matriculating (graduating from high school), that these words would ring true for Mervyn. He and one of his classmates returned to Mr. Meyer and were excited to inform him that they had passed their final high school examinations[…]"
